  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc1/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. _derive_dst_ref_from_id('rust:external:0-0:clap_complete:0-0:generate_to:external_symbol') now returns None (symbol_path_slot span-anchored, ecb954eb05 INV-fokik), so no fabricated ExternalRef. Fixtures with node:path/http/querystring and clap_complete::generate_to/Stdio::null emit single-span ids (javascript:path:0-0:extname, rust:external:0-0:clap_complete..generate_to). Composition-time validation is INV-kurup's scope. MECHANISM: colon-bearing name/scheme slots gave slot-count parsers a second span; fixed by span-anchored parsing (INV-fokik) and producer sanitization (WI-fiham, name-slot sanitizer). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-kurup,INV-vasak. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # be69
